c2c+opencode: docs should direct opencode agents to install the plugin (which c2c cli will auto-install). In lieu of that, if the opencode agent has a monitor tool they can use that + cli like claude. If they do not, hooks for message deliver + cli for sending is an options and hooks should (I think) load live for opencode agents.
